 "story": "Liverpool drew 2-2 with Nottingham Forest at Anfield in the Premier League. Nottingham Forest led at half-time after Dan Ndoye scored in the 24th minute, assisted by Morgan Gibbs-White. Alexander Isak equalised in the 60th minute, set up by Cody Gakpo, before Morgan Gibbs-White converted a penalty in the 70th minute to restore the visitors' lead. Víctor Muñoz struck in the 82nd minute, assisted by Florian Wirtz, to earn Liverpool a point, leaving them 10th of 20 in the Premier League table with two points from two games.",
